This page documents every Execution Environment (EE) registered in Ansible Automation Platform (AAP).
Each EE is a container image that defines the runtime context for Ansible automation — including
the version of `ansible-core`, Python, and every Ansible collection available to jobs that use it.

Use this page as a reference when:

- Deciding which EE to target for a new playbook or role
- Checking which version of a collection is available in a given EE
- Investigating why a collection API changed between two EE versions

